# W7g, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; from @200 its link keeps dropping (eight half-open cuts of 7 s, 0.2 s apart), then closes
# at @257.6 for 30 s: its absence debt leaves that grace about 20 s, the instance ends inside the cut (host_lost, about @278), a goes
# home after its reconnect (@288).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@195
idle until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@360
log a home after the episode
